    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">10 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Two pointers</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Opposite ends, swap inward</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/reverse-string/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 344</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Reverse String</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Put one pointer on each end, swap the two characters, step both pointers inward, stop when they meet. floor(n/2) swaps, O(n) time, O(1) extra space. The whole value of this problem is the loop condition and what the interviewer asks next.</p>\n"
